# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Project Pauli operators onto Hilbert subspaces for the latest version of Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"
msgstr "Unjurkan pengendali Pauli ke atas subruang Hilbert untuk versi terkini Pepenyahpepenjuruan kuantum berasaskan sampel (SQD)"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Project Pauli operators onto Hilbert subspaces"
msgstr "Unjurkan pengendali Pauli ke atas subruang Hilbert"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"addons/qiskit-addon-sqd/guides/project-pauli-operators-onto-hilbert-subspaces.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We show different ways of projecting a weighted linear combination of Pauli strings\n"
"into a subspace defined by a subset of size $d$ computational basis states. The\n"
"projected operator is stored as a $d \\times d$ ``scipy.sparse.coo_matrix``.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kami menunjukkan pelbagai cara untuk mengunjurkan gabungan linear berpemberat bagi rentetan Pauli\n"
"ke dalam subruang yang ditakrifkan oleh subset keadaan asas pengiraan bersaiz $d$. Pengendali\n"
"terunjur disimpan sebagai ``scipy.sparse.coo_matrix`` berukuran $d \\times d$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As an example, we consider the Hamiltonian of the one-dimensional Heisenberg model with periodic\n"
"boundary conditions and $L = 22$ spins:\n"
"$$\n"
"H = \\sum_{\\langle i, j \\rangle}\\left( \\sigma^x_i\\sigma^x_j + \\sigma^y_i\\sigma^y_j + \\sigma^z_i\\sigma^z_j \\right).\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebagai contoh, kami mempertimbangkan Hamiltonian model Heisenberg satu dimensi dengan syarat\n"
"sempadan berkala dan $L = 22$ spin:\n"
"$$\n"
"H = \\sum_{\\langle i, j \\rangle}\\left( \\sigma^x_i\\sigma^x_j + \\sigma^y_i\\sigma^y_j + \\sigma^z_i\\sigma^z_j \\right).\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This package provides two tools to perform this projection:\n"
msgstr "Pakej ini menyediakan dua alat untuk melakukan unjuran ini:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``qiskit_addon_sqd.qubit.matrix_elements_from_pauli()``: a lower-level function that returns the non-zero matrix elements of a Pauli string and the corresponding indices of the non-zero elements.\n"
msgstr "``qiskit_addon_sqd.qubit.matrix_elements_from_pauli()``: fungsi peringkat lebih rendah yang mengembalikan unsur matriks bukan sifar bagi rentetan Pauli dan indeks unsur bukan sifar yang sepadan.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``qiskit_addon_sqd.qubit.project_operator_to_subspace()``: a higher-level function that directly returns a ``scipy.sparse`` matrix.\n"
msgstr "``qiskit_addon_sqd.qubit.project_operator_to_subspace()``: a higher-level function that directly returns a ``scipy.sparse`` matrix.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide shows how to use these two tools to produce the same sparse operator.\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini menunjukkan cara menggunakan kedua-dua alat ini untuk menghasilkan pengendali jarang yang sama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Subspace definition {#subspace-definition}"
msgstr "Takrifan subruang {#subspace-definition}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For this example we generate length-22 random bitstrings. For the projection\n"
"functions to work as expected, it is essential that the bitstrings that define\n"
"the subspace are unique and sorted in ascending order according to their unsigned\n"
"integer representation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk contoh ini kami menjana rentetan bit rawak berpanjang 22. Agar fungsi unjuran\n"
"berfungsi seperti yang dijangka, adalah penting bahawa rentetan bit yang mentakrifkan\n"
"subruang adalah unik dan disusun menaik mengikut perwakilan integer tanpa tanda\n"
"masing-masing.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This can be achieved with the ``qiskit_addon_sqd.qubit.sort_and_remove_duplicates()``\n"
"function.\n"
msgstr "Ini boleh dicapai dengan fungsi ``qiskit_addon_sqd.qubit.sort_and_remove_duplicates()``.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "First method: nonzero matrix elements and indices {#first-method-nonzero-matrix-elements-and-indices}"
msgstr "Kaedah pertama: unsur matriks bukan sifar dan indeks {#first-method-nonzero-matrix-elements-and-indices}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Higher-level implementation {#higher-level-implementation}"
msgstr "Pelaksanaan peringkat lebih tinggi {#higher-level-implementation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that both implementations yield the same `coo_matrix`:\n"
msgstr "Semak bahawa kedua-dua pelaksanaan menghasilkan `coo_matrix` yang sama:\n"
